+      <div class="commit"><a href="https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/18368324a92e9199d93de3627876d03aa1189101">18368324a9</a><p><strong>Route mirror creation through async requests.</strong> Adds submission, placement polling, common lifecycle flow, and caller tests.</p></div>
+      <div class="commit"><a href="https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/cd1a56de5b94e6d95e976f57c70a0db1dd9a8163">cd1a56de5b</a><p><strong>Address review feedback.</strong> Makes the setting normally layered, preserves the broken-<code>.entire</code> exemption, retains unknown failure detail, and uses neutral async output.</p></div>
