+    </div>
+
+    <p>The resulting <a href="https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/2207">PR #2207 (Submit mirror creates through async request routes)</a> is therefore not “replace one POST with another.” It moves phase-one ownership to a durable server record while deliberately preserving the CLI’s established phase-two behavior, caller structure, and rollout escape hatch.</p>
